        {
          "say": "15 over 5, 45 over 15, 135 over 45. All equal 3.",
          "write": "ratio = 3  →  a = 3"
        },
        {
          "say": "So the rule is y equals 5 times 3 to the x.",
          "write": "y = 5 × 3ˣ"
        },
        {
          "say": "Do the power first. 5 times 2 cubed is 5 times 8, which is 40.",
          "write": "5 × 2³ = 5 × 8 = 40"
        }
